    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "2 bedroom apartment | c. 73 sq. m.\r\nAll contents included\r\nOverlooking the landscaped courtyard\r\nLarge private terrace\r\nHigh-quality finishes and specifications throughout"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Custom designed integrated Kitchen (supplied by Akalim Kitchens) with Stone Italiana quartz worktop and splashback.\r\nBespoke wardrobes by Akalim throughout all bedrooms as standard.\r\nLuxury contemporary tiles to bathroom floors and wall wet areas.\r\nWall mounted heated towel rails in all bathrooms.\r\nHigh quality sanitary-ware throughout together with extra-large shower cubicle spaces.\r\nPressurised shower system with rain head shower fittings, thermostatic mixer tap.\r\nContemporary feature architrave & skirting.\r\nSatin finish chrome door furniture throughout.\r\nNordan Eco Aluclad white timber internal window frames with external durable powder-coated aluminium paint finish in Anodic Bronze colour.\r\nInternal smooth finish painting throughout.\r\nSuperior quality internal joinery, including high quality timber doors.\r\nInterior designed entrance lobbies, lifts and common areas.\r\nIntercom / entry phone system from main block door in each apartment.\r\nThermostatic-zoned radiator central heating system in single floor apartment units by way of A-rated exhaust air heat pump.\r\nGenerous number of power points throughout including a number with provision for USB charging.\r\nA2 BER energy rating.\r\nHighly insulated air tight design."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Selling from plans, call us now to book your appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Ciara Egan"
      }
    ],
